==Appearance==
<tabber>
|-|Default=
Ribecca is a white, simplistic skeleton comprising a skull, ribcage, straight vertebrae, "V"-shaped pelvis, and limbs with visible kneecaps. Her skull is hollow and black inside and appears to have no lower jaw, thus lacking a mouth, while the upper jaw has two black lines that represent a row of three teeth. The interior of her limb's bones, her pelvis, and the top of her ribcage are also hollow. There are two curved black lines on her ribcage and two lines on the back of her hands, both representing empty space. She also has black eyebrows, four eyelashes on her eyes, droopy, bright green makeup, and purple eyeshadow with lighter lines, resembling a gleam. She wears a sweater made up of a black body with a jagged hem that exposes her torso, a fluffy, bright green collar, and two puffy, light purple and purple sleeves with a checker pattern, and bright green, fluffy hems.
|-|Vintage=
Vintage Ribecca has eyes pie-cut left, while her eyeshadow is dark gray with lighter droopy makeup. Her neon green fluff is recolored black, and her purple checker pattern is colored gray.
|-|Skele-Kitty=
Skele-Kitty Ribecca has light pink eyeshadow and makeup as well as a light pink, heart-shaped pawprint marking in the middle of her ribcage. Her sweater is elongated past her kneecaps and is dark purple with a thin collar and cat-like tail connected to the back. There are lighter purple lines across the sweater and she also has lighter scalloped patches around the sleeve openings and the tip of the tail.
|-|Haunted Topic=
Haunted Topic Ribecca is a light lavender, almost white color and wears hot pink eyeshadow with circular, dark gray makeup under her eyes. She also wears a hot pink cloth with a lighter cheetah pattern that covers her ribcage. Her sweater, now without fluff, is shorter and colored dark with a hint of pink and has serrated sleeves and a lighter trim on both parts. She wears shorts that have a single black button and are colored the lighter shade and are serrated with a hot pink trim. She wears a hot pink collar with eight white spikes around her neck and a smaller one with four on the lower part of her vertebrae between her ribcage and pelvis.
|-|Golden Skeleton=
Golden Skeleton Ribecca is light yellow with darker eyeshadow and reddish cheeks. On the left of her head, she wears gold crown with six spikes, a red oval ornamenting each. She also wears a small, golden collar decorated with six red dots. Her sweater is trimmed to reach only slightly past hear ribcage, and it is colored red with fluffy, white fur lining that is dotted red. She wears a plain, black skirt and a golden waistband that sags slightly towards the left and is adorned with eight red, gem-like dots. She wears red boots with red-dotted, white fluff on it. She also emits a faint golden glow, along with small yellow twinkles.
|-|Spooky-Time=
[[Spooky-Time Cosmetic Pack|Spooky-Time]] Ribecca has pink eyeshadow and dark purple eyebrows, along with dots of the same color slightly above the eyebrows and her cheeks, instead of droopy makeup. She dons a large pinkish-purple witch hat that's curved backwards and has pink patches connected by lighter stitches on the left of the base and the right of the tail. It has a dark purple belt around it with gold buckle towards the right. The belt also has a rotating pattern of spider webs and dots, colored with a pink and yellow gradient. Underneath the hat, it's amber colored with a pink blend towards the center. There are two black strings under the hat as well, each ending with a dark purple, spider-shaped tip. She wears a sleeveless dress with vertical stripes in hues of pink and a lighter pink like her eyeshadow, a dark purple waistband, and a collar of jagged, cream-colored fluff equipped with a gold-framed, pink, rectangular gem in the middle. On her hands are a pair of pinkish-purple gloves with cone-shaped ends that have a purple trim. She wears a pinkish-purple cape with the straps lying over shoulders and the interior design is an amber to pink gradient. It also has cream fluff along the end and has the same rotating pattern of the hat's belt. She has a pair of dark purple boots with pointed ends and gold buckles. When moving, she creates a transparent, pink and yellow trail of waves and spider webs that expands and then fades away. She produces spider web fragments of the same color that grow into full webs before disappearing.
|-|QoM=
[[Queens of Mischief Cosmetic Pack|QoM]] Ribecca has green eyeshadow and magenta makeup. Her sweater has more vivid, pinkish colors like her makeup and is shortened to her waist. Its fluff is more spiky and is colored mint green. She also wears a dark purple, jagged cloth over her ribcage. She wears green shorts with a design of two mint green bones on the sides, and jagged, mint green ends. She dons headphones that have a mostly purple headband with a magenta part in the middle, dark purple ear cups that are skull shaped with white, "angry" skull designs, and black ear cushions. She produces bouncy particles of quarter notes, treble clefs, and beamed eighth notes, all of which flash from mint to magenta. When moving, she leaves behind three different trails, all of which have a mint to magenta gradient and are transparent. One is a wavy pair of measures divided in three sections. The upper measure has a treble clef, whole rest, quarter rest, beamed eighth note on the "B" line and "E" space, and a tie for the first section. The second section has a quarter note on the "E" space, another quarter note on the same space, an eighth note on the "D" line, and a dotted quarter note on the "B" line. For the third section, a quarter rest, eighth rest, eighth note on the "B" line, and a sixteenth note with its first head on the "D" line, its second head on the "C" space, and its other heads on the "B" line. The lower measure is similar to the upper, except for the first section, the beamed eighth note is positioned two lines lower and has a natural. For the second section, the quarter note is on the "G" line, the next quarter note is on the "A” space, the eighth note is on the "B" line, and the dotted quarter note is on the "G" line and has a natural. For the third section, the last two notes are lowered by three lines. The other trails are a bouncing group of quarter notes, beamed eighth notes, and beamed sixteenth notes and a cross-bone pattern.
|-|Marigold Bloom=
Marigold Bloom Ribecca has calavera styled makeup. There are three pink petal-like markings on the upper middle of her forehead, as well as pink floral-shaped makeup bordering her eyes; a yellow heart is placed in the center of her forehead, as well as pairs of four yellow dots below her eyes; she has blue shiny eyeshadow, along with two cane-shaped marks framing the heart and three pink petals. She has a red shawl with a golden spiderweb pattern across it. She wears a long black dress with golden circular trimmings on the end of the hemline, golden sleeve cuffs, as well as blue, yellow, and pink stripes along the bottom of the skirt, with blue and yellow stripes along the sleeves. The second layer of the dress is red with golden embroidery shaped like leaves, loops, and [[wp:Cempasúchil|cempasúchiles (marigolds)]]. She wears a black necklace with a [[wp:Monarch Butterfly|monarch butterfly]] charm and gray trapezoidal adornment with yellow, pink, and blue zigzags. She additionally dons a golden cempasúchil on the top left of her head.
</tabber>

==Personality==
Interest-wise, Ribecca has an aptitude for makeup and is a costume designer, as seen in dialogues with {{CI|Gourdy|name=true}} and {{CI|Connie|name=true}}, as well as according to her Introduction Card. Ribecca loves fashion and admires those with a taste for style, such as {{CI|Poppy|name=true}} and albeit reluctantly, even {{CI|Waxwell|name=true}}. According to Gourdy's old dialogue when purchasing her, she doesn't let anything bother her, but ironically isn't above complaining however, especially when it comes to extracting [[Machines]] or some Toons' habits (like {{CI|Eclipse|name=true}} and {{CI|Pebble|name=true}}'s staring problems). Gourdy is aware of this however, as his [[Gossip]] about her is about the time she'd constantly whined when Connie was retired from being a [[Halloween Toon]], due to that fact it "wasn't fair" to her, also demonstrating just how close she can grow to others.

Overall, Ribecca is a confident, kind [[Toon]], with an occasionally more chill, laid-back attitude towards others. At times she speaks very frankly based on her interactions with others. She also has a sassier side, though this seems to only surface when interacting with rude Toons or those that irritate her (such as {{CI|Brusha|name=true}}). Given that she wanted to use {{CI|Brightney|name=true}}'s lighting to scare others as seen in their interaction, she may possess mischievous tendencies similarly to Connie and Gourdy. Ribecca also has an interest in music based on the Queens of Mischief band she formed with the other Halloween Toons.

