==Trivia==
*Ribecca shares the same [[Stat]] spread with the starters and other {{Type|Common}} [[Event Toons]] {{Small|(3 {{Star}} in all stats)}}.
*Ribecca's name is a portmanteau of the word "rib" (as in ribcage) and the feminine name Rebecca.
*Ribecca's {{Skin|Haunted Topic}} [[Skin]] is a reference to the popular clothing store brand {{wp|Hot Topic}}, which was notorious for its 'Emo' attire in the 2000's.
*According to one of her descending [[Floor]] and the [[Halloween Seasonal Room|Locked Away key gate]] dialogues, Ribecca is frequently cold, which is likely because she only dons an opened sweater and nothing else.
*According to one of her dialogues with {{CI|Gourdy|name=true}}, it's hinted that Ribecca's limbs are detachable.
**This can also be seen with her walking animation, where her ribcage bounces with each step.
*Ribecca is the only [[Toon]] featured on a purchase menu without any of the renders having a different texture than the default.
*Ribecca was the first teased [[Halloween Toon]], following a pattern where {{Type|Common}} rarity Event Toons are the first to be shown.
**She was the only Common Event Toon to not get an idle animation teaser of their lower body.
*Ribecca's interaction with {{CI|Pebble|name=true}} implies he wants to eat or gnaw on her due to her bone-built body.
*On release, Ribecca's name was misspelled as "Ribbeca" on her Intro Card. This was fixed in the [[2026 Halloween Event]].
*Despite the icon for [[Ichor Puddle]] Immunity not showing for her on the [[Toon]] selection page, Ribecca is still immune to Ichor Puddles, since her Passive [[Ability]] already prevents her from getting both the Illness and Slow [[Debuffs]].
**She's similar to {{CI|Waxwell|name=true}} in this regard, both not having the icon signifying an [[Auxiliary Stat]], but still having the functions (although Waxwell is only temporarily Light-Producing, while Ribecca is always immune to Ichor Puddle effects).
**When Ichor Leaks first released, the puddles applied a -50% [[Movement Speed]] [[Multiplier]], which affected all Toons, including Ichor Puddle Immune Toons. Curiously, Ribecca was the only Toon unaffected by this specific Multiplier, even though she shouldn't have been immune to them at the time.
***Furthermore, before her buff in the [[2026 Halloween Event]], making her explicitly immune to ''all'' negative effects, Ribecca was still immune to one effect that wasn't a Debuff (Ichor Stains from Ichor Puddles).
*Ribecca is the first [[Toon]] to have [[Ichor Leaks]] be part of her [[Mastery]]. It is called an "Ichor Spill" here.
*Ribecca is currently immune to 14 [[Debuff]]/[[Multiplier]] sources (2 being {{CI|Twisted Bassie|name=true}}'s flowers and vines separately; 2 being {{CI|Twisted Finn|name=true}}'s [[Ichor Puddles]] and {{CI|Twisted Barnaby|name=true}} separately; 2 being "Something's Fishy…!" and "Double Trouble!" Tricks), though only 9 of these are year-round.
**Technically, you could consider all Ichor Puddles as 1 source, however Ichor Leaks and Twisted Finn spawn puddles with different attributes.
**She is not immune to the negative [[Movement Speed]] Multiplier applied by {{CI|Twisted Squirm|name=true}} while grabbing her, evidently due to the fact that if she were immune, it could create conflicts with his mechanic.
**Oddly, she is also not immune to {{Debuff|Bite-sized!}} from the "Bite-sized" (and its team counterpart) Trick from [[Trick or Treat Doors]].
*Prior to the [[2026 Halloween Event]], Ribecca did not get a [[Stat]] boost from nullifying [[Debuffs]], and was not immune to non-[[Trinket]] negative [[Multipliers]] (such as {{CI|Twisted Brusha|name=true}}'s graffiti).
*Ribecca is the only [[Toon]] with a Passive [[Ability]] that directly affects [[Skill Check]].
*Ribecca and {{CI|Eclipse|name=true}} are the only [[Halloween Toons]] to not get a mask in the [[Haunted Gala]], likely due to her [[Ability]] only being effective in really situational conditions, as well as the fact it's a Passive Ability.
*According to the Queens of Mischief music video and [[Changelog|v0.29.7]] thumbnail, Ribecca can play the keytar and keyboard.
*As revealed by Ribecca in her and {{CI|Yatta|name=true}}'s interaction, she enjoys [[wp:pan de muerto|pan de muerto]], a type of sweet bread baked in the days leading up to the Day of the Dead. She also states that she doesn't like candy in this interaction.
**This interaction also confirms that [[Arthur Walton]] allowed her and the other [[Halloween Toons]] to remain active for Day of the Dead, likely owing to the holiday occurring on November 1st to 2nd, just a day after Halloween.
**This does confirm that despite only having observable teeth without an actual jaw and therefore mouth (and a digestive system in general), Ribecca can eat, regularly too.
*Ribecca is the first Common [[Event Toon]] to interact with Toons from other [[Events]].

